  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On the first night the Jia clan merchant caravan camps at Gu Yue village on Qing Mao Mountain, Fang Yuan heads for the rock gambling den because he remembers a Mudskin Toad from his previous life.",
        "chapters": [
          39
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "fac_jia_family",
          "loc_gu_yue_village",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He opens a live toad Gu from a purple gold fossil and sells it at once to Jia Jin Sheng for five hundred primeval stones.",
        "chapters": [
          42
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_jia_jin_sheng"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the Jia Jin Sheng inquiry, the gambling-den Gu Master points Fang Yuan out by the fifth purple gold rock and the Mudskin Toad sale for five hundred stones, saying other Gu Masters there saw it too.",
        "chapters": [
          55
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "investigation-echoes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_master"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Clan elders then question that same report of six rocks yielding a mudskin toad and a Liquor worm, and she confirms the toad on the fifth rock.",
        "chapters": [
          56
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "investigation-echoes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_liquor_worm"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Jiang He later greets Fang Yuan by repeating the consecutive Liquor worm and Mudskin Toad gambling luck he heard from Jiang Ya.",
        "chapters": [
          69
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "investigation-echoes",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_jiang_he",
          "char_jiang_ya"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Tie Ruo Nan lists Fang Yuan’s first-time rock gamble of six purple gold stones that yielded two live Gu, a mudskin toad and a Liquor worm, as a suspicious point of excessive luck.",
        "chapters": [
          176
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "luck-suspicion",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_tie_ruo_nan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan later recalls that this specimen had a strong life force when he cracked its purple gold rock by brute force.",
        "chapters": [
          276
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "life-force-recall",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "He also expects Shang Yan Fei’s investigation to already know he won a mudskin toad in the Jia clan caravan gamble, and he treats a second legendary win as a risk that would invite suspicion of a rock-checking method.",
        "chapters": [
          277
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "life-force-recall",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shang_yan_fei"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
